{"speciesId":84,"names":{"fr":"Doduo","es":"Doduo","en":"Doduo","ja":"ドードー"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"red","text":"A bird that makes up for its poor flying with its fast foot speed. Leaves giant footprints."},{"language":"en","version":"blue","text":"A bird that makes up for its poor flying with its fast foot speed. Leaves giant footprints."},{"language":"en","version":"yellow","text":"Its short wings make flying dif­ ficult. Instead, this POKéMON runs at high speed on developed legs."},{"language":"en","version":"gold","text":"By alternately raising and lower­ ing its two heads, it balances itself to be more stable while running."},{"language":"en","version":"silver","text":"It races through grassy plains with powerful strides, leaving footprints up to four inches deep."},{"language":"en","version":"crystal","text":"It lives on a grassy plain where it can see a long way. If it sees an enemy, it runs away at 60 mph."},{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"DODUO’s two heads never sleep at the same time. Its two heads take turns sleeping, so one head can always keep watch for enemies while the other one sleeps."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"DODUO’s two heads contain completely identical brains. A scientific study reported that on rare occasions, there will be examples of this POKéMON possessing different sets of brains."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"Even while eating or sleeping, one of the heads remains always vigilant for any sign of danger. When threatened, it flees at over 60 miles per hour."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"A two-headed POKéMON that was discovered as a sudden mutation. It runs at a pace of over 60 miles per hour."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"A bird that makes up for its poor flying with its fast foot speed. Leaves giant footprints."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"By alternately raising and lowering its two heads, it balances itself to be more stable while running."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It races through grassy plains with powerful strides, leaving footprints up to four inches deep."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Ses deux cerveaux semblent communiquer leurs émotions grâce à un lien télépathique."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses deux cerveaux semblent communiquer leurs émotions grâce à un lien télépathique."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ce Pokémon à deux têtes est le résultat d’une soudaine mutation. Il peut courir jusqu’à 100 km/h."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Este Pokémon de dos cabezas es el resultado de una mutación. Cuando corre, puede alcanzar casi 100 km por hora."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"A two-headed Pokémon that was discovered as a sudden mutation. It runs at a pace of over 60 miles per hour."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"突然変異で 見つかった ２つの 頭を 持つ ポケモン。 時速１００キロで 走る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Ses deux cerveaux semblent communiquer leurs émotions grâce à un lien télépathique."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Parece que los cerebros de sus dos cabezas se comunican por telepatía."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The brains in its two heads appear to communicate emotions to each other with a telepathic power."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"２つの 頭の 脳みそは テレパシーのような 力で 気持ちを 通じ合わせているらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les deux têtes de Doduo ne dorment jamais en même temps. Elles se reposent à tour de rôle pour que l’une puisse monter la garde pendant que l’autre dort."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Las dos cabezas de Doduo duermen de forma independiente, siempre por turnos. Mientras una duerme, la otra hace de centinela por si aparecen enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Doduo’s two heads never sleep at the same time. Its two heads take turns sleeping, so one head can always keep watch for enemies while the other one sleeps."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２つの 頭が 同時に 眠ることは ない。 寝ている とき 敵から 襲われない ように 代りばんこで 見張りを しているからだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les deux têtes de Doduo contiennent des cerveaux totalement identiques. Une étude scientifique démontra que dans des cas rares, certains de ces Pokémon possèdent des cerveaux différents."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Doduo es un Pokémon bicéfalo de cerebros idénticos. Según un estudio científico, podría darse el extraño caso de que hubiera algún Doduo con cerebros distintos."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Doduo’s two heads contain completely identical brains. A scientific study reported that on rare occasions, there will be examples of this Pokémon possessing different sets of brains."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"２つの 頭は 同じ 脳みそを 持つ。 まれに 別々の 脳を 持った ドードーが 生まれてくると 研究で 報告された。"},{"language":"fr","version":"lets-go-pikachu"